 "case:locations.carpark.description": "A gravel car park on the headland above Croyde Bay, with room for forty cars and, this week, none. A café in a converted shipping container, a pay-and-display machine, a bench at the cliff edge and a gate into Westcott Farm. The end bay, nearest the sea, still has police tape on its post.",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_bay.label": "The end bay",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_bay.text": "Where Moss stood all night, nose to the sea. Nothing on the gravel now but tyre marks and a strip of police tape snapping on its post. From here you can see the camera over the café door, pointing straight across the car park.",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_bench.label": "The bench",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_bench.text": "A teak bench at the very edge of the cliff, weathered silver, with a brass plaque on the backrest. Someone has cable-tied a fresh bunch of carnations to the arm.",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_bin.label": "The bin",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_bin.text": "The car park bin, not emptied since the weekend. On top of the rubbish, still in their cellophane, a dozen white roses.",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_cafe.label": "The café",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_cafe.text": "The Lookout: coffee, bacon rolls and wetsuit hire, open weekends out of season. Dan Kellow runs it. There’s a camera above the door, and a lifeboat collecting tin on the counter.",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_gate.label": "The field gate",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_gate.text": "A steel gate into Westcott Farm, padlocked, with a hand-painted board wired to the bars. Beyond it, sheep, and a quad bike parked by a feed trough.",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_machine.label": "Pay machine",
 "case:locations.carpark.hotspots.hs_cp_machine.text": "‘MARRAM POINT. PAY & DISPLAY 8 a.m.–6 p.m. NO OVERNIGHT SLEEPING. NO CAMPING.’ Underneath, someone has added in marker pen: ‘nobody checks in winter x’.",
 "case:locations.carpark.name": "Marram Point",
 "case:locations.carpark.summary": "The clifftop car park where Tess died, and Dan’s café.",
 "case:locations.compound.art.props.0.label": "Moss",
 "case:locations.compound.art.props.1.label": "Sliding door",
 "case:locations.compound.art.props.2.label": "Other vehicles",
